{%- comment -%}
Not a section to add in the editor: it is fetched by the "Complete your routine" block of the main product (snippets/complete-routine.liquid) through
the search page - /search?type=product&q=id:<id>&section_id=complete-routine-card - to get the card content of the last product the visitor viewed,
the same way the theme's "Recently viewed products" section loads its products. Renders nothing when that product is not available.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- for item in search.results -%}
  {%- if item.object_type == 'product' and item.available -%}
    {%- render 'complete-routine-card-content', extra: item -%}
    {%- break -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Complete routine card",
  "tag": "div",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
